  {
   "kind": "field_value",
   "field_name": "Primary Text",
   "text": "Cozy Designs Born from Love | Pump Your Way: Explore M5 & M9 | Compare Functions: M5 & M9 | Key Functions of M5 & M9 Pumps | M5 vs M9: Features at a Glance | Choose Your Perfect Pump Today | {KeyWord:momcozy m9 vs m5} | Smart Hands-Free Pump M9 | Momcozy M9 App-Controlled Pump | Momcozy M5 Pain-Free Pump | Momcozy M5: Quiet & Portable | Personalized Pumping with M9 | Momcozy® Official | Momcozy® Pumping Options | Momcozy® With Moms Always | Compare suction levels, noise, portability, and smart control between M5 and M9. | Find your perfect wearable pump: manual simplicity of M5 or digitized finesse of M9. | Lightweight M5 wearable pump delivers soothing, efficient pumping anywhere. | Smart, portable M9 pump supports busy moms with app personalization and quiet performance.",
   "anchor": "#广告文案明细/recvuJYdObJwyY/Primary Text"
  },
  {
   "kind": "field_value",
   "field_name": "修改建议",
   "text": "删除 safest/100% safe/zero risk/perfect 等虚假安全承诺，以及 fits all breast shapes/one size fits all/一定不损伤/适合所有胸型等绝对化适配承诺（best/#1/No.1 排名最高级已放开） ▸ 删除 pain-free/no pain/without pain/pain relief/less pain/无痛/缓解疼痛等疼痛功效承诺（含 sans douleur/schmerzfrei/sin dolor），只保留 comfort/gentle 与缓解胀满不适 discomfort 的表述",
